      Interactive mode for reviewing plans and managing backlog\n  monitor      Dashboard showing agent status and task progress\n  recover      Recover agent from error state (clear stale locks, reset tasks)\n  push         Push worktree branches to target with AI conflict resolution\n  pull         Pull integration branch into worktrees with AI conflict resolution\n  sync         Full sync: push all completed work, then pull into all worktrees\n  reset        Hard reset worktrees to a specific branch\n  list         List all agents and their status\n\ntotal 36\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 root root 4096 Aug 22 18:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 root root   93 Aug 22 18:35 ..\n-rw-------. 1 root root  266 Aug 22 18:51 .agent.lock\n-rw-------. 1 root root    0 Aug 22 18:36 .agent.lock.flock\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   44 Aug 22 18:35 .git\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root  135 Aug 22 18:51 .gitignore\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root   22 Aug 22 18:51 data\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 root root   86 Aug 22 18:51 huddle\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root   31 Aug 22 18:35 loom-prompts\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   56 Aug 22 18:51 requirements.txt\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 root root 4746 Aug 22 18:51 start.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 root root  558 Aug 22 18:35 timer.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root 4096 Aug 22 18:51 vendor\n/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1/huddle/:\ntotal 20\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 root root   86 Aug 22 18:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 root root 4096 Aug 22 18:51 ..\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   65 Aug 22 18:51 __init__.py\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root  383 Aug 22 18:51 __main__.py\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root   42 Aug 22 18:51 api\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root  319 Aug 22 18:51 app.py\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root 2058 Aug 22 18:51 config.py\n\n/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1/huddle/api/:\ntotal 8\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root  42 Aug 22 18:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 root root  86 Aug 22 18:51 ..\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root 317 Aug 22 18:51 __init__.py\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root 351 Aug 22 18:51 health.py\n/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1/timer.sh\n/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1/start.sh\n18:declare -A NODE_PIDS=()\n101:    sleep 0.1\n106:start_node() {\n118:  NODE_PIDS[$node_id]=$!\n123:  for node_id in \"${!NODE_PIDS[@]}\"; do\n124:    pid=\"${NODE_PIDS[$node_id]:-}\"\n132:  wait 2>/dev/null || true\n147:start_node 0 8000\n148:start_node 1 8001\n149:start_node 2 8002\n151:log \"Cluster running (foreground). Nodes: ${NODE_PIDS[*]}; redis_pid=${REDIS_PID:-reused}\"\n160:      wait \"$REDIS_PID\" 2>/dev/null || true\n177:    pid=\"${NODE_PIDS[$local_id]:-}\"\n180:      start_node \"$local_id\" \"$port\"\n185:  sleep 1\nGNU bash, version 5.2.21(1)-release (aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu)\nDesign note only: architect must not run the app\n","stderr":"","executionTime":137,"interleavedOutput":"time=2026-08-22T18:52:05.843Z level=INFO msg=\"opened existing embedded fleet-db client\" url=http://127.0.0.1:35473\nID:       MARATHON-21\nTitle:    HTTP node auto-restart within 60s\nStatus:   in_progress\nPriority: 0\nType:     task\nAssignee: app-architect-1\nOwner:    marathon-harness\nParent:   MARATHON-1\nLabels:   [architect backend]\n\nDescription:\nstart.sh must respawn any SIGKILLed HTTP node within 60s without external action so all three ports answer again. Surviving nodes keep serving during outage.\nloom - Agent Management CLI\n\nManage Claude Code agents working in parallel across workspace repos.\n\nGETTING STARTED\n  1. Select a FleetDB-backed workspace with registered repos.\n\n  2. Create tasks for agents to work on:\n     loom task create --title=\"Add login feature\" --type=feature --priority=2\n\n  3. Run agents:\n     loom plan falcon    # Creates design, sets status=review\n     loom lead           # Review and approve plans\n     loom task falcon    # Implements approved design\n\nKEY CONCEPTS\n  Workspaces   FleetDB-backed repo groups where agents work independently.\n\n  Agents       Claude processes that work on tasks:\n               - 'plan' agent: researches and creates designs\n               - 'task' agent: implements approved designs\n\n  FleetDB      Issue tracker. Tasks flow through states:\n               open → in_progress → review → open → closed\n\n  Auto Mode    --auto flag runs agents continuously, processing multiple\n               tasks until stopped (Ctrl+C) or idle timeout.\n\nCOMMANDS\n  plan         Run a planning agent (creates designs, marks for review)\n  task         Run an implementation agent (implements approved tasks)\n  lead         Interactive mode for reviewing plans and managing backlog\n  monitor      Dashboard showing agent status and task progress\n  recover      Recover agent from error state (clear stale locks, reset tasks)\n  push         Push worktree branches to target with AI conflict resolution\n  pull         Pull integration branch into worktrees with AI conflict resolution\n  sync         Full sync: push all completed work, then pull into all worktrees\n  reset        Hard reset worktrees to a specific branch\n  list         List all agents and their status\n\ntotal 36\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 root root 4096 Aug 22 18:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 root root   93 Aug 22 18:35 ..\n-rw-------. 1 root root  266 Aug 22 18:51 .agent.lock\n-rw-------. 1 root root    0 Aug 22 18:36 .agent.lock.flock\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   44 Aug 22 18:35 .git\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root  135 Aug 22 18:51 .gitignore\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root   22 Aug 22 18:51 data\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 root root   86 Aug 22 18:51 huddle\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root   31 Aug 22 18:35 loom-prompts\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   56 Aug 22 18:51 requirements.txt\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 root root 4746 Aug 22 18:51 start.sh\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 root root  558 Aug 22 18:35 timer.sh\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root 4096 Aug 22 18:51 vendor\n/work/ws/worktrees/app/app-architect-1/huddle/:\ntotal 20\ndrwxr-xr-x. 3 root root   86 Aug 22 18:51 .\ndrwxr-xr-x. 6 root root 4096 Aug 22 18:51 ..\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root   65 Aug 22 18:51 __init__.py\n-rw-r--r--. 1 root root  383 Aug 22 18:51 __main__.py\ndrwxr-xr-x. 2 root root   42 Aug 22 18:51 api\n-rw-r--